spans.s:
वि-√ गण् P. -गणयति (ind.p. -गणय्य),
to reckon, compute, calculate (Pass. to be reckoned i.e. amount to), Yājñ.; R.;
to deliberate, consider, ponder, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to regard as, take for (with double acc.), Ragh.; Kathās.;
to esteem, regard (अ-विगणय्य, ‘not taking notice of’), Kād.; BhP.;
to disregard, take no notice of Pañcat.; BhP.

वि-√ गम् P. -गच्छति, to go asunder, sever, separate, AV.; MBh.;
to go away, depart, disappear, cease, die, AV. &c. &c.:
Caus. -गमयति, to cause to go or pass away, speed (time), Śak.

वि-√ गाह् Ā. -गाहते (ep. also ˚ति), to plunge or dive into, bathe in, enter, penetrate, pervade, betake one's self into (acc. or loc.), RV. &c. &c.;
to pierce, AV.;
to agitate, disturb, Ragh.;
to be engrossed by or intent upon, ponder, BhP.;
to follow, practise, Kum.;
to reach, obtain, Bhartṛ.;
to approach, fall (as night), MBh. :
Pass. -गाह्यते, to be plunged into or penetrated, to be entered into or engaged upon, Kāv.; Pañcat.

वि-√ ग्रह् P. Ā. -गृह्णाति, ˚णीते (Ved. also -गृभ्णाति, ˚णीते), to stretch out or apart, spread out, AV.;
to distribute, divide (esp. to draw out fluids at several times), RV.; ŚBr.; TBr.; KātyŚr.;
to hold apart, separate, isolate, ŚrS.;
 (in gram.) to analyse (cf. वि-ग्रह);
to wage war, fight against (acc.), MBh.;
to quarrel, contend with (instr. with or without सह, or सार्धम्), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to seize, lay hold of (acc. or loc.), MBh.; Mṛcch.;
to receive in a friendly manner, welcome, MBh.;
to perceive, observe, BhP. :
Caus. -ग्राहयति, to cause to fight, cause to wage war against, Das, Bhaṭṭ. :
Desid. -जिघृक्षति, to wish to fight against, Bhaṭṭ.
